Also, check out the links at
the bottom for a cool talk

00:04:22.920 --> 00:04:24.180
from the TensorFlow team.

00:04:24.180 --> 00:04:26.940
And don't forget, when it
comes to scaling your machine

00:04:26.940 --> 00:04:30.600
learning service in production,
Cloud Machine Learning Engine's

00:04:30.600 --> 00:04:33.690
got your back.

00:04:33.690 --> 00:04:36.660
Thanks for watching that
